1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Sixteenth  Episode
The Puppet Show

15
00:01:50,741 --> 00:01:52,732
Come, my little friends!

16
00:01:52,781 --> 00:01:55,898
Come, one and all, to see
my puppets!

17
00:01:56,461 --> 00:01:59,214
Come on, come! Come, one and all!

18
00:01:59,261 --> 00:02:04,415
Come all,
the show is about to begin!

19
00:02:05,021 --> 00:02:07,012
Come to me, everyone, friends!

20
00:02:07,461 --> 00:02:12,615
The puppet show of old Antonio
is starting!

21
00:02:14,701 --> 00:02:17,261
Come! You won't regret it!

22
00:02:20,101 --> 00:02:24,219
My great, old show
is always new, my children!

23
00:02:24,261 --> 00:02:29,494
For your delight, here are
Antonio's puppets! Come!

24
00:02:30,941 --> 00:02:34,456
The puppets!
Let's go see the puppets!

25
00:02:35,901 --> 00:02:38,176
How wonderful! I wonder what they are doing..!

26
00:02:38,421 --> 00:02:40,412
It's a puppet show!

27
00:02:41,261 --> 00:02:45,220
Boys and girls,
are you all here around me? Good!

28
00:02:45,261 --> 00:02:49,459
Then we can begin,
girls and boys,

29
00:02:49,501 --> 00:02:52,652
with the greatest show!
Gather around me!

30
00:02:53,021 --> 00:02:55,137
I can't see!

31
00:02:55,181 --> 00:02:58,332
Let me introduce a beautiful puppet:
little Corette!

32
00:03:07,181 --> 00:03:10,093
How are you?
I am little Corette!

33
00:03:12,141 --> 00:03:16,214
I'm happy to meet you! Cheer
for me, please! Great!

34
00:03:16,261 --> 00:03:19,094
In this show, I will play
the part of Princess Snow.

35
00:03:19,141 --> 00:03:21,336
Please,
follow closely!

36
00:03:24,021 --> 00:03:28,219
And now you will see the episode
of the Princess and the monster!

37
00:03:42,341 --> 00:03:44,901
I have never seen
such a pretty little girl!

38
00:03:49,581 --> 00:03:52,300
What a nice little morsel,
tender and delicate!

39
00:03:52,341 --> 00:03:55,253
The monster is about to eat
the Princess!

40
00:03:55,301 --> 00:03:59,010
I was just hungry! My mouth
waters just looking at her!

41
00:04:00,181 --> 00:04:04,254
Well, children! Do you say the
Princess will be eaten or not?

42
00:04:04,301 --> 00:04:07,816
We don't want her to be eaten!
We want to see what happens!

43
00:04:07,861 --> 00:04:10,853
I'm sorry, that's all for today!
Tomorrow bring me the money...

44
00:04:10,901 --> 00:04:14,211
...and I'll show you what happens next!
Oh, my poor little Corette!

45
00:04:14,261 --> 00:04:17,697
I really hope you'll be saved!
So, agreed, children?

46
00:04:17,741 --> 00:04:20,699
Bring me the money
and I will show you the rest.

47
00:04:21,021 --> 00:04:22,818
Agreed?

48
00:04:52,101 --> 00:04:55,332
Here is the puppet wagon
of old Antonio.

49
00:04:55,381 --> 00:04:58,293
I wonder if little Corette is there!
I can't wait...

50
00:04:58,341 --> 00:05:01,811
...to see little
Corette playing Princess Snow again.

51
00:05:01,861 --> 00:05:05,740
Don't worry, Corette! When
the monster comes, I will defend you!

52
00:05:06,101 --> 00:05:08,740
Don't worry,
the monster won't eat you!

53
00:05:08,781 --> 00:05:11,420
As soon as he arrives, I'll hit him
and knock him to the ground!

54
00:05:12,141 --> 00:05:14,336
Who is shouting like that at night?

55
00:05:15,581 --> 00:05:19,176
- What are you doing here?
- I wanted to see little Corette

56
00:05:19,821 --> 00:05:22,494
What? You want to see Corette?!

57
00:05:22,821 --> 00:05:25,540
You'll see her tomorrow,
if you bring the money.

58
00:05:25,581 --> 00:05:29,096
Come on, don't go wandering around like that!
Go on, go home!

59
00:05:40,821 --> 00:05:43,415
I didn't know this job
was so difficult!

60
00:05:43,701 --> 00:05:47,774
My dear, dear beautiful little coins of mine!
How tenderly I love you!

61
00:05:47,821 --> 00:05:49,812
Can I speak to you?

62
00:05:49,861 --> 00:05:52,614
No, I'm busy now! I absolutely
cannot pay attention to you!

63
00:05:52,661 --> 00:05:54,697
But I brought you
ten jars of water!

64
00:05:54,741 --> 00:05:57,096
Well done! So, now,
you can go home.

65
00:05:57,141 --> 00:05:59,735
But you promised to pay me
for this work!

66
00:05:59,781 --> 00:06:01,692
What do you want to do with the money?

67
00:06:01,741 --> 00:06:03,493
I'm going to the puppet show

68
00:06:03,541 --> 00:06:05,657
Fine, here is the money
that I promised you.

69
00:06:05,701 --> 00:06:07,612
So little?!
You cheated me!

70
00:06:07,661 --> 00:06:09,652
Isn't it enough for you?
I hate greedy children!

71
00:06:09,701 --> 00:06:12,295
You don't want to drive me to ruin
for your entertainment?

72
00:06:12,341 --> 00:06:15,651
Go away! If you ask me for more money,
I'll have you declared legally incompetent!

73
00:06:15,860 --> 00:06:18,011
Get out! Help!

74
00:06:18,260 --> 00:06:21,014
Thank goodness! Under no circumstances
would I have given him any more money.

75
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:23,017
Not even a single cent more!

76
00:06:23,060 --> 00:06:25,291
You have to learn to
save from a young age!

77
00:06:25,340 --> 00:06:28,333
Oh, my dear money!
I will never let you go!

78
00:06:28,380 --> 00:06:31,452
You are the only friends I
have, you are my only comfort!

79
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:35,050
To me you are like children!
Goodnight, my dear little coins!

80
00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:51,012
He's already fallen asleep!

81
00:07:01,020 --> 00:07:03,137
Oh, dear little coin, where
are you going all alone?

82
00:07:03,180 --> 00:07:05,536
You must not stay awake
so late!

83
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:08,015
Now I'll put you to bed
together with your little brothers.

84
00:07:08,060 --> 00:07:10,370
All right, my little dear?

85
00:07:12,420 --> 00:07:15,492
Thief! I'm ruined!

86
00:07:16,100 --> 00:07:20,731
Help! Thief! Thief!

87
00:07:23,420 --> 00:07:27,699
Thief! Help! Quick! Thief!

88
00:07:27,740 --> 00:07:31,290
Help! Help!

89
00:07:32,140 --> 00:07:34,132
Help!

90
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:38,894
There we go!
And with the utmost care!

91
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:51,018
No one knows that old Antonio,
so loved by children,

92
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:53,655
is actually a formidable thief!

93
00:07:53,700 --> 00:07:57,137
Tonight I snatched much more
than I had anticipated.

94
00:07:59,340 --> 00:08:03,015
I'm good and clever!
I want to make as much money as possible,

95
00:08:03,060 --> 00:08:06,019
so afterwards I can enjoy life
with my puppets!

96
00:08:07,580 --> 00:08:09,890
Oh, Corette, how pretty you are!

97
00:08:09,940 --> 00:08:12,455
Everyone loves you
and tomorrow they will come for you,

98
00:08:12,500 --> 00:08:14,935
so I will make more money
with tomorrow's show,

99
00:08:14,980 --> 00:08:17,370
in which I will show the children
Princess Snow.

100
00:08:20,300 --> 00:08:22,610
There's Sapphire! I'll go to him!

101
00:08:27,580 --> 00:08:29,776
- Where have you been, Tink?
- In town, to see...

102
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:32,540
...a puppet show!
It was exciting!

103
00:08:32,660 --> 00:08:35,892
Ah, really? I would love to go
to see it! What will be on?

104
00:08:35,940 --> 00:08:38,535
Today there is a show
about Princess Snow and the monster.

105
00:08:38,580 --> 00:08:41,015
- It must be really nice!
- You've made me curious.

106
00:08:41,060 --> 00:08:43,575
- I really want to go! Shall we go?
- We can't,

107
00:08:43,620 --> 00:08:46,374
- because we don't have any money.
- I hadn't thought of that.

108
00:08:46,421 --> 00:08:48,730
That old puppeteer
doesn't let anyone see the show...

109
00:08:48,781 --> 00:08:50,772
..who doesn't bring him money.

110
00:08:50,821 --> 00:08:53,460
We could get some.
Let me think...

111
00:08:53,501 --> 00:08:56,538
Even without money, somehow
we'll manage to see the show.

112
00:08:56,581 --> 00:08:59,539
There is a beautiful
puppet! Her name is Corette!

113
00:08:59,581 --> 00:09:02,857
I can't wait to see her again,
so shall we run to town?

114
00:09:04,101 --> 00:09:08,014
It would be dishonest to watch the
show without paying, don't you think?

115
00:09:08,061 --> 00:09:11,451
Even if it's dishonest, I want to see
Corette! I want to see her! I want...

116
00:09:19,301 --> 00:09:22,532
Oh, no!
Good heavens!

117
00:09:22,661 --> 00:09:25,300
Who was it?
Who took away my roof?

118
00:09:25,341 --> 00:09:28,811
The projectile hit
Doctor Uranaru's room.

119
00:09:28,861 --> 00:09:31,819
Ah, it was you, Prince!
Now this is too much!

120
00:09:32,701 --> 00:09:35,340
Exalted Doctor Uranaru,
we beg you:

121
00:09:35,381 --> 00:09:40,011
Give us some money to see
the puppet show!

122
00:09:40,061 --> 00:09:42,336
You broke my roof and
you dare ask me for money?!

123
00:09:42,381 --> 00:09:44,531
- What nerve!
- Please, we beg you!

124
00:09:44,581 --> 00:09:47,493
Before wasting it,
you have to earn money!

125
00:09:50,901 --> 00:09:52,619
Let's run!

126
00:09:52,661 --> 00:09:54,811
You rascals! Forget about money!

127
00:09:54,861 --> 00:09:58,012
Just let me catch you, though,
and I'll teach you a proper lesson!

128
00:10:01,901 --> 00:10:05,291
Come on! Come on, kids!
Come see old Antonio!

129
00:10:05,861 --> 00:10:10,013
The show is starting! Little
Corette against the monster!

130
00:10:11,021 --> 00:10:13,171
So, did you bring the money?

131
00:10:13,221 --> 00:10:16,531
Those who didn't bring it
won't be able to watch the show!

132
00:10:16,781 --> 00:10:19,249
Great! Then let's begin!

133
00:10:20,901 --> 00:10:23,779
Oh, darn! I want to see
the show too!

134
00:10:25,101 --> 00:10:28,013
Tink, we can't!
Be reasonable!

135
00:10:28,061 --> 00:10:30,700
I've got it!
I've got a great idea!

136
00:10:30,741 --> 00:10:33,050
Really?
What's your idea?

137
00:10:33,101 --> 00:10:35,854
You'll see! Do as I say,
get back in the barrel!

138
00:10:36,021 --> 00:10:38,899
Today too, just like
every day, Princess Snow...

139
00:10:38,941 --> 00:10:41,660
...has come into the
woods to gather firewood.

140
00:10:41,701 --> 00:10:45,489
Oh, what a wonderful day!
Hello, little bird! How are you?

141
00:10:45,541 --> 00:10:49,170
Oh, those raspberries look
delicious! I'll pick some!

142
00:10:49,221 --> 00:10:53,339
What a beautiful little pond! I'll wash my face
in this clear, cool water!

143
00:10:53,381 --> 00:10:55,337
The Princess is very cheerful..

144
00:10:55,381 --> 00:10:58,373
...and her walk takes place
among a thousand flowers, she sings happily,

145
00:10:58,421 --> 00:11:01,891
when, suddenly,
the monster comes out of the woods!

146
00:11:04,181 --> 00:11:05,614
Help!

147
00:11:05,661 --> 00:11:07,492
- Poor Corette!
- Tink!

148
00:11:07,541 --> 00:11:11,295
Here comes the monster
who will eat Princess Snow!

149
00:11:11,581 --> 00:11:13,253
Help!

150
00:11:13,301 --> 00:11:15,769
- Hey, monster!
- Tink, stay down!

151
00:11:15,821 --> 00:11:18,619
It's not time to get up yet!

152
00:11:18,661 --> 00:11:20,458
But I must...!

153
00:11:21,661 --> 00:11:23,652
Help!

154
00:11:25,901 --> 00:11:27,732
Help!

155
00:11:29,261 --> 00:11:32,253
Hey, ugly monster!
Don't touch little Corette!

156
00:11:33,621 --> 00:11:37,853
Hey! You're watching the show
without paying! What nerve!

157
00:11:41,821 --> 00:11:43,413
Forgive us!

158
00:11:43,461 --> 00:11:45,816
Watching the show without paying
is worse than stealing!

159
00:11:45,861 --> 00:11:48,216
We are sorry,
but we don't have any money with us!

160
00:11:48,261 --> 00:11:50,900
If you'll accept it,
I will give you this sword instead

161
00:11:50,941 --> 00:11:52,818
- Here, take it!
- Good heavens!

162
00:11:52,861 --> 00:11:55,170
But the hilt of this sword
is studded with diamonds!

163
00:11:55,221 --> 00:11:57,689
Alright, come on in!
You can watch the show..

164
00:11:57,741 --> 00:12:00,301
...from the front row!
Hey, my sword!

165
00:12:01,541 --> 00:12:04,499
Prince Sapphire, I've
finally managed to find you!

166
00:12:04,541 --> 00:12:06,372
- Prince?!
- Of course!

167
00:12:06,421 --> 00:12:09,299
And the sword is the symbol of
his rank, so he cannot part with it!

168
00:12:09,621 --> 00:12:12,454
Now you will return to the
castle with me and no show!

169
00:12:12,501 --> 00:12:14,731
No! No, I don't want to! I don't want to!

170
00:12:14,781 --> 00:12:17,454
I don't want to return to
the castle! I want to stay here!

171
00:12:17,501 --> 00:12:20,015
If you do not obey me,
I will tell your mother!

172
00:12:20,621 --> 00:12:23,897
That sword is wonderful!
It's worth a fortune!

173
00:12:27,021 --> 00:12:29,899
Excuse me, little one, do you
know well the inside of the castle?

174
00:12:29,941 --> 00:12:32,011
Yes, I know it. Why?

175
00:12:32,061 --> 00:12:35,497
Please, tell me what the inside
of the Prince's castle is like.

176
00:12:35,541 --> 00:12:38,260
I have always wanted to
know what a castle is like...

177
00:12:38,301 --> 00:12:40,212
and a Prince's bedroom!

178
00:12:40,261 --> 00:12:43,697
If you tell me, I will let
you see the show for free.

179
00:12:44,821 --> 00:12:48,211
Will I be able to see it? Why are you
so interested in the inside of the castle?

180
00:12:48,261 --> 00:12:50,411
It's just curiosity.

181
00:12:50,461 --> 00:12:54,249
If you describe it to me, I'll have
Corette give you a special kiss!

182
00:12:55,021 --> 00:12:56,898
So, will you tell me?

183
00:13:11,701 --> 00:13:14,010
Thanks to that little
one, I was able to draw...

184
00:13:14,061 --> 00:13:16,495
...this map
of the inside of the castle.

185
00:13:17,261 --> 00:13:19,900
I've got it! To the Prince's bedroom!

186
00:13:28,221 --> 00:13:30,735
Here it is,
just where I imagined!

187
00:13:41,021 --> 00:13:43,251
It was as easy as
drinking a glass of water.

188
00:13:43,301 --> 00:13:46,611
You did well, Corette! You
deserve a nice new dress!

189
00:13:46,661 --> 00:13:49,221
Oh, the little one! Hello!

190
00:13:49,621 --> 00:13:51,373
Antonio, I saw you, you know?

191
00:13:51,421 --> 00:13:53,696
You made little Corette
commit a theft!

192
00:13:53,741 --> 00:13:55,891
You, little one, go away
and leave me in peace!

193
00:13:55,941 --> 00:13:58,819
No! I will never allow you to take
away the sword of my friend Sapphire!

194
00:13:58,861 --> 00:14:00,579
I won't allow it!

195
00:14:01,741 --> 00:14:04,335
What's happening?
Who's on the roof?

196
00:14:05,021 --> 00:14:07,012
Did you see? You made
me drop my sword!

197
00:14:07,061 --> 00:14:09,017
I wanted to take a look
at it and now, instead...

198
00:14:09,061 --> 00:14:11,291
How dare you say that?!
But you wanted to steal it!

199
00:14:11,341 --> 00:14:13,616
Who's that shouting up there?

200
00:14:15,741 --> 00:14:17,732
I won't let you escape!

201
00:14:20,181 --> 00:14:22,137
You won't get away!

202
00:14:25,741 --> 00:14:28,539
Now go back to Sapphire!
You must apologize to him!

203
00:14:28,581 --> 00:14:31,493
And if you make little Corette
commit another theft, I'll...

204
00:14:32,501 --> 00:14:34,935
Please don't hurt me! Help me!

205
00:14:34,981 --> 00:14:37,495
I'll do whatever you
want, but please, help me!

206
00:14:37,541 --> 00:14:40,294
So you're supposed to be a thief,
huh? What were you doing here?

207
00:14:40,341 --> 00:14:42,093
Please forgive me!

208
00:14:42,141 --> 00:14:44,609
I'll do anything! Forgive me!

209
00:14:44,661 --> 00:14:47,733
What kind of thief are you?!
I've never seen such a thief!

210
00:14:47,781 --> 00:14:49,817
Please, forgive me!

211
00:14:50,221 --> 00:14:54,533
Old man, if you want me to forgive
you, you'll have to do what I want!

212
00:14:55,181 --> 00:14:59,015
Otherwise, I will hand you over to the
executioner and order him to cut off your head!

213
00:14:59,701 --> 00:15:01,931
- All right...
- No, don't obey him!

214
00:15:01,981 --> 00:15:04,939
- He will ask you to do something bad!
- Shut up! How dare you?

215
00:15:13,301 --> 00:15:15,940
And don't get in
my way again! Got it?

216
00:15:15,981 --> 00:15:17,619
Wait!

217
00:15:17,861 --> 00:15:20,329
Now come, old man. Come with me.

218
00:15:20,381 --> 00:15:22,212
Wait, old Antonio!

219
00:15:22,261 --> 00:15:24,172
Listen to me! Don't listen to Nylon!

220
00:15:24,221 --> 00:15:26,132
Don't go with him! Wait!

221
00:15:26,221 --> 00:15:29,293
I'm sure he will ask you
to hurt Sapphire!

222
00:15:34,101 --> 00:15:36,569
Are you saying there will be
a show at the castle?

223
00:15:36,621 --> 00:15:39,010
Yes, Your Highness! It's a surprise
I wanted to give you!

224
00:15:39,061 --> 00:15:41,621
The puppeteer has come
with his wagon to the royal castle.

225
00:15:41,661 --> 00:15:45,176
- Hooray!
- Everything is already set up in the courtyard!

226
00:15:53,901 --> 00:15:57,018
Ladies and gentlemen,
the show will begin shortly...

227
00:15:57,061 --> 00:15:59,529
...which is titled:
"Prince or Princess?"

228
00:15:59,581 --> 00:16:01,617
Judging by the title, it seems interesting!

229
00:16:02,101 --> 00:16:04,774
I didn't sleep at all last
night, to write the story.

230
00:16:04,821 --> 00:16:06,812
We shall see
how Sapphire and the Queen...

231
00:16:06,861 --> 00:16:09,250
...will react to
the show, Grand Duke.

232
00:16:11,021 --> 00:16:13,171
The Princess
goes to play in the woods,

233
00:16:13,221 --> 00:16:15,576
avoiding her sewing lesson
today as well.

234
00:16:15,621 --> 00:16:17,930
How funny!
She is dressed just like me!

235
00:16:25,341 --> 00:16:27,536
Hurry up, friend!
I must get into the castle!

236
00:16:27,581 --> 00:16:30,891
I am sure Nylon is using
Corette for something shady!

237
00:16:32,421 --> 00:16:34,537
Today I will practice
fencing!

238
00:16:34,581 --> 00:16:37,300
- Princess! Princess!
- What's the matter, Nylon?

239
00:16:37,341 --> 00:16:40,617
Princess, you are a girl, so
please accept these flowers!

240
00:16:40,661 --> 00:16:42,731
You should wear feminine clothes!

241
00:16:42,781 --> 00:16:45,932
- No, I don't want to!
- Please forgive me!

242
00:16:46,421 --> 00:16:48,412
I am a boy, understand?

243
00:16:49,421 --> 00:16:52,333
Why does the Princess
lie, saying that she is a boy?

244
00:16:52,381 --> 00:16:54,815
She has no idea how
worried I am about her.

245
00:16:54,861 --> 00:16:57,819
This fills me
with anxiety and fear!

246
00:16:58,221 --> 00:17:00,291
- Good heavens!
- Mother!

247
00:17:02,141 --> 00:17:06,100
This must be a scheme
by Duralumin and Nylon!

248
00:17:06,181 --> 00:17:09,537
- Please, let's keep calm.
- You're right.

249
00:17:09,581 --> 00:17:12,732
Princess, why do you lie
saying that you are a boy?

250
00:17:12,781 --> 00:17:14,817
Because I want to be King! A
King can do whatever he wants...

251
00:17:14,861 --> 00:17:16,817
...and send to the gallows
whoever he doesn't like!

252
00:17:17,061 --> 00:17:19,655
Stop it! Sapphire
is not like that at all!

253
00:17:19,701 --> 00:17:21,612
Stay calm, Mother! Please!

254
00:17:21,661 --> 00:17:26,018
What is it, Your Majesty? Don't
tell me you don't like this show!

255
00:17:26,061 --> 00:17:28,177
You too, Prince,
have turned pale.

256
00:17:28,221 --> 00:17:30,212
It would be best to
stop, then, wouldn't it?

257
00:17:30,261 --> 00:17:32,172
I am doing just fine! Continue!

258
00:17:32,221 --> 00:17:34,132
The Queen seems shaken.
I bet she won't hold out...

259
00:17:34,181 --> 00:17:36,741
...and will soon confess
that Sapphire is a girl.

260
00:17:37,021 --> 00:17:39,330
Good! Now I'll be able to become King!

261
00:17:39,581 --> 00:17:43,017
You are so wicked, Your Highness, that
you will end up devoured by Mephisto!

262
00:17:43,061 --> 00:17:46,258
I don't care about what you say! I
am not afraid of anything or anyone!

263
00:17:46,301 --> 00:17:48,132
No one can beat me! There!

264
00:17:55,661 --> 00:17:58,129
- Please, stop it!
- Mother!

265
00:17:58,221 --> 00:18:01,372
Stop it immediately! I
feel sorry for you, Sapphire!

266
00:18:01,581 --> 00:18:04,175
Don't worry, Mother,
it's just a show.

267
00:18:04,221 --> 00:18:06,132
What harm could it possibly do us?

268
00:18:08,381 --> 00:18:10,690
I am Mephisto and
I come from hell!

269
00:18:10,741 --> 00:18:13,938
Where is the Prince who
tells lies? Ah, there you are!

270
00:18:15,101 --> 00:18:17,331
Good!
I really think I will devour you!

271
00:18:17,381 --> 00:18:19,611
Yes, yes, just like that!
I can't wait to devo...

272
00:18:19,661 --> 00:18:21,538
Damn it! What's happening?

273
00:18:21,581 --> 00:18:24,459
Blast it, it's not moving!
How come?

274
00:18:25,301 --> 00:18:27,690
I am the real Mephisto!

275
00:18:27,741 --> 00:18:30,574
I will move on my own,
even if I'm stuck!

276
00:18:31,021 --> 00:18:33,455
The puppet
is moving by itself?!

277
00:18:34,661 --> 00:18:38,620
Listen, everyone! I will kill
anyone who hurts Corette!

278
00:18:39,501 --> 00:18:42,015
Corette, I'm your friend, you know?

279
00:18:43,901 --> 00:18:46,813
He is the real Mephisto!
He will punish me!

280
00:18:47,181 --> 00:18:49,058
- Listen, Antonio!
- Yes?

281
00:18:49,101 --> 00:18:51,615
Promise me you won't
do any more bad deeds!

282
00:18:51,821 --> 00:18:54,619
As you wish! As you wish! I promise
you not to do any more bad deeds!

283
00:18:54,661 --> 00:18:57,050
So please, forgive me!
I will leave right away!

284
00:18:58,501 --> 00:19:00,298
Tink!

285
00:19:01,181 --> 00:19:02,819
Away!

286
00:19:05,061 --> 00:19:07,097
Damn it!

287
00:19:10,261 --> 00:19:12,491
Help! Help!

288
00:19:13,021 --> 00:19:15,171
Stop, you little brat!
I'll make you pay...

289
00:19:15,221 --> 00:19:17,018
...for ruining
my show!

290
00:19:17,061 --> 00:19:19,131
Stop the cart, you old thief!

291
00:19:28,661 --> 00:19:31,414
Mamma mia! I am at the
mercy of two scoundrels!

292
00:19:32,021 --> 00:19:34,012
It's no use running, you old geezer!

293
00:19:34,061 --> 00:19:36,177
I'll send both of you
to the next world! Stop!

294
00:19:42,421 --> 00:19:44,457
Mamma mia! Mamma mia!

295
00:19:44,741 --> 00:19:47,619
- Run! Run, my little horse!
- Take that!

296
00:19:50,381 --> 00:19:52,099
The fire!

297
00:19:52,141 --> 00:19:55,099
Damn it! My cart is on fire
and I can't stop!

298
00:19:59,021 --> 00:20:01,296
You two must be burned alive!

299
00:20:17,501 --> 00:20:20,652
My poor puppets! Corette!

300
00:20:24,101 --> 00:20:26,410
I must try to get out
as soon as possible!

301
00:20:32,661 --> 00:20:34,333
Corette!

302
00:21:02,461 --> 00:21:04,452
My poor Corette!

303
00:21:04,741 --> 00:21:07,255
And poor
all my other puppets!

304
00:21:07,301 --> 00:21:09,053
Now I will never see them again!

305
00:21:09,101 --> 00:21:13,413
This thought makes me cry
like a fountain!

306
00:21:15,341 --> 00:21:17,730
Now I will see puppets everywhere!

307
00:21:18,021 --> 00:21:22,014
My dear puppets! But now it's
too late! It's all my fault!

308
00:21:22,061 --> 00:21:24,939
Heaven has punished me
for being bad!

309
00:21:24,981 --> 00:21:27,893
To chase away the sadness,
the only way is to sleep!

310
00:21:28,661 --> 00:21:31,095
Oh, my Corette!

311
00:21:32,781 --> 00:21:35,579
Dear old Antonio, it's me!
Did you call me?

312
00:21:35,901 --> 00:21:38,131
Yes, my dear Corette!

313
00:21:39,101 --> 00:21:41,410
You caught a cold, didn't you?

314
00:21:41,461 --> 00:21:44,498
Yes, Uncle Antonio! When the cart
plunged into the river,

315
00:21:44,541 --> 00:21:47,055
I stayed in the freezing water
for so long!

316
00:21:48,901 --> 00:21:51,017
You missed me, didn't you?

317
00:21:51,061 --> 00:21:54,371
Yes, I missed you so much! Even though
I know this is only a dream,

318
00:21:54,421 --> 00:21:56,616
I am very happy to see you again

319
00:21:56,661 --> 00:21:58,413
But this is not a dream

320
00:21:58,621 --> 00:22:01,693
It's not a dream?!
But then... let me see!

321
00:22:03,341 --> 00:22:05,901
You really are my little Corette!

322
00:22:05,941 --> 00:22:08,091
My little one, how happy I am!

323
00:22:08,261 --> 00:22:12,049
You should have been more careful!
Didn't you see there were wires?

324
00:22:14,021 --> 00:22:16,489
I am so sorry,
I didn't pay attention!

325
00:22:16,541 --> 00:22:19,499
I was too happy!
You saved Corette, right?

326
00:22:19,541 --> 00:22:22,931
Yes, it was me. And I saved all
the other puppets for you too!

327
00:22:23,621 --> 00:22:27,170
What?! Hooray!

328
00:22:28,501 --> 00:22:32,016
Thank you, child! Today
you made me really so happy!

329
00:22:32,061 --> 00:22:34,256
Promise
that you won't do any more harm?

330
00:22:34,301 --> 00:22:38,010
Of course, little one! Don't worry!
I will never commit a theft again!

331
00:22:38,181 --> 00:22:42,299
To thank you, I will let you
see the puppet show for free!

332
00:22:42,661 --> 00:22:46,574
Really?! Sapphire! You
can show yourself now!

333
00:22:46,621 --> 00:22:49,294
He said we can watch
the show without paying!

334
00:22:49,341 --> 00:22:52,651
Have fun, kids! Here is
the show of old Antonio!

335
00:22:52,701 --> 00:22:56,091
We are about to begin! I
present to you Princess Snow!

336
00:22:56,141 --> 00:22:58,609
She is truly very lovely!

337
00:22:59,341 --> 00:23:01,332
Hello! Hello!

338
00:23:04,421 --> 00:23:06,173
Here is the monster again!

339
00:23:06,221 --> 00:23:08,018
You will not harm Corette!

340
00:23:08,901 --> 00:23:11,131
I will kill you, you ugly monster!

341
00:23:13,461 --> 00:23:15,292
What are you doing, Tink?

342
00:23:15,341 --> 00:23:18,811
- Did you see that I beat him?
- Well done! You did great!

343
00:23:20,301 --> 00:23:23,099
No! No, I don't want my
friends to see me like this!

344
00:23:23,141 --> 00:23:25,291
Please, let's finish the story!

345
00:23:27,701 --> 00:23:30,340
We'll see each other
again in a few days, guys!

346
00:24:00,140 --> 00:24:03,760
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

